## Stack & responsibility

- TypeScript / Node 22; both packaged as JS GitHub Actions (`action.yml` + `dist/`).
- Claude CLI Action generates testcase JSON only (readonly planning).
- QA Agent validates (Ajv) and executes (Playwright UI + HTTP checks).
- Do not use Vercel AI SDK or the Anthropic Messages API for planning.

## Implementation order

Follow Steps 1→8. Step 4 = Claude CLI Action (+ artifact I/O), not an in-process CLI wrapper. The shipped flow is generate → validate → run P0 → comment.

## Out of scope (MVP)

Slack/Teams, Jira/Linear, flaky detection, target-repo config file, exploratory Claude tool loops, committing generated Playwright tests into the consumer repo.
